Subject: [PATCH 07/11] W5: wgGetStats (statistics without key material)

Per peer: public_key, endpoint, last_handshake_time_sec/nsec, tx_bytes, rx_bytes, through uapiFilter. wgGetConfig
(which carries private_key/preshared_key in hex, K14) stays only for the upstream Swift adapter and is not used by
LockPlus.
